From 87247daadc1fa874ab4fd05e90f58e0e8b3eab3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Sidebottom <chris.sidebottom@arm.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Jul 2025 11:30:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add NEOVERSEV2 target support

Did a quick run around to make `TARGET=NEVOERSEV2` build successfully.

Fixes #5385
---
